<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Untitled Document</title>
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Georgia:wght@400;700&amp;family=Arial:wght@400;700&amp;display=swap');

        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            width: 100%;
            background: #ffffff;
            color: #000000;
            line-height: 1.4;
        }

        .page {
            width: 8.5in;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0.5in;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            border: 1px solid #cccccc;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }

        .header {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #000;
            padding-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .title {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin: 30px 0 10px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .date {
            font-size: 14px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            text-align: right;
        }

        p {
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        ul, ol {
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            padding-left: 20px;
        }

        li {
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }

        .signature {
            margin-top: 40px;
            font-size: 16px;
            text-align: right;
        }

        .placeholder {
            width: 100%;
            height: 150px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            background: #f0f0f0;
            border: 1px dashed #999;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #666;
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
        }

        .placeholder-caption {
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 5px;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #666;
        }

        .column {
            display: flex;
            gap: 30px;
        }

        .column-left, .column-right {
            flex: 1;
        }

        @media print {
            body { background: white; }
            .page { box-shadow: none; border: none; width: 100%; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="page">
        <div class="header">SAMPLE DOCUMENT LAYOUT</div>

        <div class="title">Main Title</div>
        <div class="date">August 1, 2026</div>

        <p>Paragraph one with normal spacing. This is the first line of body text.</p>

        <p>Second paragraph continues the flow. Line breaks are preserved where they appear in the original layout.</p>

        <div class="column">
            <div class="column-left">
                <p>Left column text starts here. This demonstrates a two-column layout as seen in many documents.</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Item one in bullet list</li>
                    <li>Item two continues</li>
                    <li>Item three</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="column-right">
                <p>Right column text. Text blocks are placed side-by-side to match spatial separation.</p>
                <ol>
                    <li>Numbered list item</li>
                    <li>Second item</li>
                </ol>
            </div>
        </div>

        <p>Paragraph after the columns. The layout flows from left column to right column exactly as the original document image would show.</p>

        <div class="placeholder">
            [Image: placeholder diagram centered horizontally]
            <div class="placeholder-caption">[Diagram: centered]</div>
        </div>

        <p>Text resumes below the image placeholder. The image occupies the full width with 20px margins above and below.</p>

        <div class="signature">
            Signature line<br>
            ________________________<br>
            John Doe<br>
            Date: August 1, 2026
        </div>

        <p>Final paragraph with no additional elements. All content is extracted verbatim and positioned according to the detected spatial layout.</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
